<title>USA: NationsBank says 96 pct Boatman in stock swap.</title>
<headline>NationsBank says 96 pct Boatman in stock swap.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBank Corp said Wednesday that about 96 percent of Boatman Bancshares Inc's common shares will be exchanged for NationsBank stock as a result of its merger with Boatman.</p>
<p>NationsBank said it will issue 98 million shares to complete the exchange.  It said about 4 percent of Boatman shares are being exchanged for cash.</p>
</text>
